    {
      "subId": "7620003",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to the treasure hunters",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "762000201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "762000201": {
            "id": "762000201",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Jukka",
            "text": "Excuse me, have you seen a tiger-striped cat around here by any chance?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "762000202"
            ]
          },
          "762000202": {
            "id": "762000202",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Linnea",
            "text": "A tiger-striped cat? Hmm, I don't think so... Lumi, did you notice one?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "762000203"
            ]
          },
          "762000203": {
            "id": "762000203",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Lumi",
            "text": "Ya-ho?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "762000204"
            ]
          },
          "762000204": {
            "id": "762000204",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Linnea",
            "text": "Looks like Lumi hasn't seen it either. Did your cat go missing? I can help you look for it! I know this area pretty well.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "762000205"
            ]
          },
          "762000205": {
            "id": "762000205",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Marja",
            "text": "Hey, Jukka! We don't have the spare money to hire an adventurer. And besides, it's just a silly cat. Let it end up wherever it wants!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "762000206"
            ]
          },
          "762000206": {
            "id": "762000206",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Jukka",
            "text": "Don't say that, Marja. It'd be sad if it heard you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "762000207"
            ]
          },
          "762000207": {
            "id": "762000207",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Marja",
            "text": "As if it could hear us! If it could, it would've come to us by now — we've been shouting for ages.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "762000208"
            ]
          },
          "762000208": {
            "id": "762000208",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Linnea",
            "text": "No need to pay me a commission for that. I was going to check out the area anyway, so I'll keep an eye out while I'm at it. Let's go, Lumi!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "762000209"
            ]
          },
          "762000209": {
            "id": "762000209",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Linnea",
            "text": "(There was nothing here not long ago, and now there are so many Twinleaf Pitcher Plants growing.)",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "762000210"
            ]
          },
          "762000210": {
            "id": "762000210",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Linnea",
            "text": "(Maybe some animal brought the seeds here, but I can't just let them spread like this...)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7620004",
      "subQuestName": "Find the Tiger-Striped Cat",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "762000501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "762000501": {
            "id": "762000501",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Linnea",
            "text": "Lumi, do you think it's here too?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "762000502"
            ]
          },
          "762000502": {
            "id": "762000502",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Lumi",
            "text": "Ya-hoho!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "762000503"
            ]
          },
          "762000503": {
            "id": "762000503",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Black Screen",
            "text": "The trapped cat is rescued...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "762000504"
            ]
          },
          "762000504": {
            "id": "762000504",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Linnea",
            "text": "So you're the one they've been looking for, huh? Hmm... doesn't look like you've got any injuries. But if we'd found you any later... who knows what could've happened.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "762000505"
            ]
          },
          "762000505": {
            "id": "762000505",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Linnea",
            "text": "Anyway, let's get you back to your friends first!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7620005",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to the treasure hunters",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "762000801"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "762000801": {
            "id": "762000801",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Marja",
            "text": "Silly cat... where on earth are you— Oh! You found it!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "762000802"
            ]
          },
          "762000802": {
            "id": "762000802",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Linnea",
            "text": "It got trapped in those Twinleaf Pitcher Plants over there. They're plants, yes, but they're carnivorous, and can digest Moonglow Fireflies in just a few days...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "762000803"
            ]
          },
          "762000803": {
            "id": "762000803",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Linnea",
            "text": "Good thing we found it in time. It's just a little weak now, but if we'd been any later... who knows what might've happened.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "762000804"
            ]
          },
          "762000804": {
            "id": "762000804",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Jukka",
            "text": "G—Goodness... That's dangerous...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "762000805"
            ]
          },
          "762000805": {
            "id": "762000805",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Marja",
            "text": "Hmph, can't blame anyone but yourself for crawling in there, silly cat.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "762000806"
            ]
          },
          "762000806": {
            "id": "762000806",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Linnea",
            "text": "Well, it's not really the cat's fault. These Twinleaf Pitcher Plants give off a special scent. Humans aren't affected, but insects and other little creatures might get drawn in.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "762000807"
            ]
          },
          "762000807": {
            "id": "762000807",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Linnea",
            "text": "That's how the plants catch their prey. There's an unusual number of pitcher plants here, small animals are affected by their presence too.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "762000808"
            ]
          },
          "762000808": {
            "id": "762000808",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Marja",
            "text": "Oh... I see. Anyway, having this many of these plants grow here is definitely not a good sign, right?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "762000809"
            ]
          },
          "762000809": {
            "id": "762000809",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Linnea",
            "text": "That's right. If we leave them alone, they could cause some real trouble...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "762000810"
            ]
          },
          "762000810": {
            "id": "762000810",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Marja",
            "text": "Alright, then we'll handle the weeding. Jukka, come help too!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "762000811"
            ]
          },
          "762000811": {
            "id": "762000811",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Marja",
            "text": "These plants made our silly cat suffer so much. We have to return the favor.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "762000812"
            ]
          },
          "762000812": {
            "id": "762000812",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Black Screen",
            "text": "With the help of the two treasure hunters, the unusual overgrowth of Twinleaf Pitcher Plants in the area is finally cleared...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "762000813"
            ]
          },
          "762000813": {
            "id": "762000813",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Marja",
            "text": "Phew... we're finally done. Time to head back to Nasha Town. Thanks a lot, miss, for helping us find this silly cat. If it weren't for your help, who knows how long it would've been trapped.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "762000814"
            ]
          },
          "762000814": {
            "id": "762000814",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Jukka",
            "text": "Come to think of it, Marja, if you hadn't yelled so loudly earlier, we might have found it even sooner...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "762000815"
            ]
          },
          "762000815": {
            "id": "762000815",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Marja",
            "text": "Wh—What are you talking about? Anyway, the important thing is it's safe now.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "762000816"
            ]
          },
          "762000816": {
            "id": "762000816",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Linnea",
            "text": "(Though she calls it \"silly cat\" all the time, she really does care about her companion, hehe.)",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "762000817"
            ]
          },
          "762000817": {
            "id": "762000817",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Linnea",
            "text": "That's right. The important thing is it's safe. It's dangerous out here in the wilderness, so you guys have to be careful, too.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "762000818"
            ]
          },
          "762000818": {
            "id": "762000818",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Jukka",
            "text": "Thank you. We will.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "762000819"
            ]
          },
          "762000819": {
            "id": "762000819",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Marja",
            "text": "And good luck with your investigation. Goodbye!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
